main = draw f = snd (Normal, \x -> Uniform) in f (Uniform < 0.5)
-- Found by the admission-totality fuzz oracle (docs task
-- fuzz-admission-oracle-bugs, item 2). `f` is a lambda only through `snd` of a
-- tuple with a random sibling, which forward chaining cannot see through; the
-- compile died resolving it. CalleeNormalize now substitutes the projected
-- lambda literal, and the binding is dead. main is the Uniform.
